        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. University service: as department head/chair, program director, or governance officer; on administrative and governance, department, college, school or university committees; and other tasks as deemed necessary by the University. In addition, service will be recognized when a unit member serves as a member of the MAU appeals board, as a member of the MAU disciplinary committee or as a member of a joint labor-management committee or task force established by this Agreement. Unit members who serve as the MAU grievance chair will receive service credit of up to three (3) workload units.",
