        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "13.2.2 Unit members have additional professional responsibilities including, but not limited to: advising students; participating in MAU and statewide committees; maintaining reasonable office hours; working collaboratively and productively with colleagues; participating in conferences and seminars; taking academic leaves and sabbaticals that provide additional opportunities for scholarship; and preparation and participation in traditional academic functions.",
